{"aligned_passages":[{"anchor":"the-series-the-greedy-rule-and-finite-identities","mapping_field":"claim_ids","mapping_ref":"sha256:3a21b4e02b3d2d930ab451d425e96d8c6264fdace0f75c4a360ed23d391dbb69/papers/long.json","paper_href":"/api/v1/papers/long?manifest=d70bb160bfefc1577b48160e899f6ed7d8cca34f47089a3f1d1b07c8915075fa","passage_ref":"sha256:d4cff05445a8091e88a0215dc5b8dd28497dfc8c7317357a03f3ed6190b2e19c/papers/long.md/sha256:3a21b4e02b3d2d930ab451d425e96d8c6264fdace0f75c4a360ed23d391dbb69/papers/long.json/passages/the-series-the-greedy-rule-and-finite-identities","query_href":"/api/v1/papers/query?manifest=d70bb160bfefc1577b48160e899f6ed7d8cca34f47089a3f1d1b07c8915075fa&paper=long&passage=the-series-the-greedy-rule-and-finite-identities","reading_href":"/api/v1/papers/reading?manifest=d70bb160bfefc1577b48160e899f6ed7d8cca34f47089a3f1d1b07c8915075fa&paper=long&passage=the-series-the-greedy-rule-and-finite-identities","span":{"end_byte":135267,"end_line":1356,"start_byte":112658,"start_line":1103},"stage":"long"}],"lenses":{"consumers":"/api/v1/graph?manifest=d70bb160bfefc1577b48160e899f6ed7d8cca34f47089a3f1d1b07c8915075fa&view=arguments&node=long.thm-real-form&direction=consumers&assumptions=true","direct_passages":"/api/v1/papers/query?manifest=d70bb160bfefc1577b48160e899f6ed7d8cca34f47089a3f1d1b07c8915075fa&node=long.thm-real-form&relation=direct","prerequisite_uses":"/api/v1/papers/query?manifest=d70bb160bfefc1577b48160e899f6ed7d8cca34f47089a3f1d1b07c8915075fa&node=long.thm-real-form&relation=prerequisites","prerequisites":"/api/v1/graph?manifest=d70bb160bfefc1577b48160e899f6ed7d8cca34f47089a3f1d1b07c8915075fa&view=arguments&node=long.thm-real-form&assumptions=true"},"neighborhood_href":"/api/v1/neighborhood?manifest=d70bb160bfefc1577b48160e899f6ed7d8cca34f47089a3f1d1b07c8915075fa&ref=sha256%3Af31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5%2Fnodes%2Flong.thm-real-form","record":{"assumption_ids":[],"boundary":"The evidence mapping records a Lean proof of exactly this statement. Lean status per paper is kept in authored/evidence-status.json.","citation_ids":["cite.long.thm-real-form"],"evidence_ids":["mapping.long.thm-real-form"],"id":"long.thm-real-form","kind":"claim","label":"Long record Theorem 5.15 (Real (non-integer) form of the quotient identity)","locator":"Long record Theorem 5.15, p. 42, label thm:real-form","source_id":"paper.long.pdf","statement":"*Let $x_d := 1/(2^d-1)$ and define the constant\n$$\nC \\;:=\\; \\sum_{d \\ge 2} x_d \\;-\\; \\tfrac12 \\;=\\; E - \\tfrac32 \\;=\\; 0.1066951524152917\\ldots,\n$$\nwhere $E$ is the Erdős–Borwein constant. Then, for every quotient row $n \\ge 6$,\n$$\n\n\\Delta_n \\;=\\; 4^n \\Big( \\sum_{d \\in \\mathrm{Skip}_n} x_d \\;-\\; C \\Big) \\;+\\; \\eta_n, \\qquad\n|\\eta_n| < 2n+2.\n\\tag{II}\n$$\n**Proof.** Splitting the full series at $n$ gives\n$$\n\\eta_n=4^nR_{n-1}-2^{n+1}\n       +\\sum_{d\\in D_n}\\left\\{\\frac{4^n}{2^d-1}\\right\\}.\n$$\nThe tail bounds $2^{-(n-1)}<R_{n-1}\\le\n2^{-(n-1)}+\\tfrac23 4^{-(n-1)}$ and $|D_n|\\le n-2$ show $0<\\eta_n<n+2/3<2n+2$.*\n\n***Use of the error bound.** For $H>2n+2$, the condition $|\\sum_{d\\in\\mathrm{Skip}_n}x_d-C|>(H+2n+2)/4^n$ is sufficient for $|\\Delta_n|>H$. Conversely, $|\\Delta_n|>H$ implies $|\\sum_{d\\in\\mathrm{Skip}_n}x_d-C|>(H-2n-2)/4^n$. Thus a square-root-exponential deviation corresponds to a separation of order $2^{-3n/2}$, with the displayed additive error retained. This is not an exact equivalence after simply discarding that error.\\\n**Note:** $C = E - 3/2$ is Mersenne-specific, but the shape “scaled deviation $=$ $4^n \\cdot$(finite skip-sum $-$ target constant) $+ O(n)$” is a template, not yet matched to any analogous constant on the \\#249 side.*","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/nodes/long.thm-real-form","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/nodes/long.thm-real-form","id":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/edges/%5B%22long.thm-real-form%22%2C%22lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR20.mersenne_constant_decimal%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/edges/%5B%22long.thm-real-form%22%2C%22lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR20.mersenne_constant_decimal%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","to":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/nodes/lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR20.mersenne_constant_decimal"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/nodes/long.thm-real-form","id":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/edges/%5B%22long.thm-real-form%22%2C%22lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR20.paper_real_quotient_core%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/edges/%5B%22long.thm-real-form%22%2C%22lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR20.paper_real_quotient_core%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","to":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/nodes/lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR20.paper_real_quotient_core"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/nodes/long.thm-real-form","id":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/edges/%5B%22long.thm-real-form%22%2C%22lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR20.paper_real_quotient_margins%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:f31aeb6174afd909393ada9bc329cd29dc9b1b6a0de8f72a49f18ab372947af5/edges/%5B%22long.thm-real